==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[envigorate]]
* [[envigourate]] {{qualifier|rare}}
* [[invigourate]]

===Verb===
{{en-verb|invigorat}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To impart [[vigor]], [[strength]], or [[vitality]] to.
#: ''Exercise is '''invigorating'''.''
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To [[heighten]] or [[intensify]].
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To give life or energy to.
#: ''The cold water '''invigorated''' him.''
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To make [[lively]].

====Related terms====
* [[invigorating]]
* [[invigoratingly]]
* [[invigoration]]
* [[invigorator]]

